    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u2605 Attack on Toys: LOCAL &amp; ONLINE  SPLIT-SCREEN - 2025 UPDATE! NOW AVAILABLE!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605 Remembering playing Split Screen with family or goes to friend house and bringing your own controller &amp; memory card? You could do exactly that with <strong>Attack on Toys!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully <strong>Dynamic  Offline / Online</strong>\u00a0Split Screen and <strong>Multi Profile - Save Data Memory System</strong>! Please<i> see below for more details &amp; features about the Split Screen! \ud83e\udc0b</i></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>\ud83d\udd27 Attack on Toys: STEAM\u00ae Workshop - Mods &amp; Level Creations</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/6871e84b97f730c0ac3a16a266fc7530.avif?t=1750505567\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">\ud83c\udfb2 Attack on Toys - <strong>TOY-BOX</strong>:<li>Create your own Level Creations! <br></li><li>Edit &amp; Customize Community Level Creations.<br></li><li>Play &amp; Share Levels. Made by you and Community.<br><br>\ud83d\udd27 Attack on Toys - <strong>MODS</strong>:<br></li><li>Grow your Toys Mod Collection.<br></li><li>Create &amp; Combine Community Mods into your own Level Creations!</li></ul><br>\ud83d\udd27 Attack on Toys: How to create Mods &amp; Toy-Box - <strong>Guide Here!</strong></p><br><h1>\u2605 Attack on Toys: LOCAL &amp; ONLINE  SPLIT-SCREEN</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/79a71c66590adb19f17dc7ba70cf16f5.poster.avif?t=1750505567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/79a71c66590adb19f17dc7ba70cf16f5.webm?t=1750505567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/79a71c66590adb19f17dc7ba70cf16f5.mp4?t=1750505567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete <i>Single Player</i> &amp; <i>Split Screen</i> experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <i><strong>Local / Offline</strong></i><strong> Split Screen</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <i><strong>Online</strong></i><strong> Split Screen</strong> with your close friends using <strong>STEAM\u00ae REMOTE PLAY TOGETHER</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite your\u00a0<strong>STEAM\u00ae Friend List</strong> or use <strong><u>Link Invitation</u></strong> to play together! <i>Anyone can join even if they don't own Attack on Toys!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multi Profile - Save Data</strong>: Use your own save data profile and access your Squad, Item, and Loadout! Battle, Level Up, and Save your Progress together with your friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with up to <strong>4-Players</strong> and only <strong>ONE</strong> copy of Attack on Toys is required!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play using Mouse &amp; Keyboard (<i>P1</i>) or Gamepad Controller (<i>P1, P2, P3, P4</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own <i>custom map</i> battle for Split Screen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack on Toys Split Screen is <i>fully compatible</i> with all game modes (PvP, Invasion, Skirmish, Conquest, Toy-Box, Custom Toy-Box, Mods, and <strong>STEAM\u00ae Workshops</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 First time trying to play <strong>Online Split Screen</strong> using <strong>STEAM\u00ae REMOTE PLAY TOGETHER</strong>? Please see the tutorial at <i>Attack on Toys STEAM\u00ae Discussion or STEAM\u00ae Guide</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/74b3c0ac318f30795617bd78df93c57a.avif?t=1750505567\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>\u2691 Attack on Toys: Early Access Note</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 <strong>Attack on Toys</strong> development will focus more towards <strong>Single Player content</strong> rather than Multiplayer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 At current state Attack on Toys Multiplayer is LAN Only\u201d. LAN PvP Official Maps &amp; LAN Co-op Invasion Official Maps only! (Toy-Box or Workshop is for Single Player Only)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2605 Supported Gamepad: Xbox, Switch Pro, DualShock, other Generic Gamepad</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/dae71a32e183b95ca93400aa9ee3773e.poster.avif?t=1750505567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/dae71a32e183b95ca93400aa9ee3773e.webm?t=1750505567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/dae71a32e183b95ca93400aa9ee3773e.mp4?t=1750505567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Relive <strong>Your Childhood Toys</strong> comes to <strong><i>life</i></strong>! Build your Army Toys, make battle scenario, watch the <strong>Toys</strong> battling each other, and customize your play with <strong>Attack on Toys</strong> Toy Box. Command your Army Toys to fight against another toys strategically and keep them alive during battle!<br><br><strong>Attack on Toys</strong> is a 3rd-person shooter mixed with combination of Real-time strategy as Toy Army Soldiers. Pick your favourite Army color and ride to the battle! Use Tank, Helicopter, Jeep, robot mech? and build your own Army Squad to win the battle against other Toys.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/da213e85c9e278b5c6ca0d2bc79a4f71.avif?t=1750505567\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>INVASION</strong>: Defend your HQ with unlimited wave of enemies invasion.<br></li><li> <strong>TERROR INVASION</strong>: Defend your HQ with unlimited wave of enemies invasion. <i><strong>(Zombies!, Cockroach, Spider)</strong></i><br></li><li> <strong>SKIRMISH</strong>: Destroy all enemies HQ to win.<br></li><li> <strong>CONQUEST</strong>: Claim and defend your territories against enemies.<br></li><li> <strong>PvP 'LAN'</strong>: Destroy all Enemy Player HQ to win.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/a18621bb198715ad05964d931490aa1f.avif?t=1750505567\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Massive Army Toys Battle<br></li><li> Third-Person Shooter with mix of Real-Time Strategy Map<br></li><li> First-Person view<br></li><li> Destructible Building &amp; Enemy<br></li><li> Level up and Customize your Toy Soldier<br></li><li> Create your own Squad and Level up your Squad through battle<br></li><li> Permanent Death on Squad Member<br></li><li> Collectible Items, Weapons, Backpacks, Hats, and much more<br></li><li> Driveable Vehicles, Towers, Helicopters, and Planes<br></li><li> Play &amp; Share Toy-Box level creations on STEAM\u00ae Workshop</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/ea3f1b47cf9e4c464a3d222e11f7da5f.avif?t=1750505567\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Army Men<br></li><li> HYPERCHARGE: Unboxed<br></li><li> The Mean Greens - Plastic Warfare<br></li><li> Home Wars</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269690/extras/d297def851b87fa7b6241adb1f49b7e9.avif?t=1750505567\" /></div><br>\u2605 Purchasing <strong>Attack on Toys: STEAM\u00ae Edition</strong> is to help development of the Game quicker.<br>\u2605 <strong>STEAM\u00ae Edition</strong> will unlock Steam platform features like Save Cloud, Achievements, Leaderboards, and Workshop.",
